            "detailed_description": "Do you have what it takes to become the top Mafia overlord?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate your City by building black market buildings. But choose wisely! Some Buildings are better than others and they must be placed with strategy for maximum effect!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLevel up and upgrade your Crew to run jobs for you that give you Cash bonuses or special Powers!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures City Building strategy and a full Leaderboard!",
