                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Easy to pass the time idle game.\n\n- F2P friendly.\n- While there is paid features/ currency none are required to play at all. You can 100% get by F2P.\n- Build up your city with limited buildings and let them generate money.\n- Use money to unlock more slots to build.\n- Complete missions to level characters and unlock zones.\n- Most characters available F2P.\n- Levelling characters is slow but doable.\n- Money will generate whether your online/ offline.\n- Not much strategy involved unless you consider what building & placement \"strategy.\"\n- When buildings are busted its fast to re-open and resume.\n- Not played seasons so not sure how that works, but you don't need to join.\n- Achievements a plus, looks like you can unlock all with some time playing.\n- Honestly not a lot of work involved except logging in here and there to re-open, build when you can.\n- Despite it not offering much but very simple play it helps cure some boredom and pass the time.\n- If your looking for some in-depth strategy city builder then look elsewhere.\n\nOverall 4/10",
